{"quest_id": 6599, "name": "証明・守護の力", "description": "クゥイルに力を示すため、模擬戦を行う\n王子軍の面々。屈強な山賊たちの攻勢にも\n揺るがぬ堅固さを見せつけよ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "雄飛せし鷲獅騎兵", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920117, "map_no": 3324, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 162, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100512, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 249, "global_id": 248, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 180, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 157, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100480, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 247, "global_id": 246, "spawn_sec": 4}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 180, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 157, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100496, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 248, "global_id": 247, "spawn_sec": 4}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3200, "attack": 220, "base_hp": 3200, "base_attack": 220, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 162, "move_speed": 550.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097168, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 1, "spawn_sec": 18}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 61, "move_speed": 1700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2110336, "special_effect_id": 164, "missile_id": 45, "master_id": 30285, "global_id": 3904, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 53}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2800, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 172, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097328, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 12, "spawn_sec": 66}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 4500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_range": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 59, "move_speed": 1700.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2116176, "special_effect_id": 164, "missile_id": 45, "master_id": 31313, "global_id": 4932, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 138}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "クゥイル", "text": "――まずは、王子達の\n守護の力を見極めさせていただきます。", "face": "u702"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "守護……ですか？", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "クゥイル", "text": "はい、英雄には強力な敵を押し留め、\n守るべき者を守る力が求められる、\nと言いますからね。", "face": "u702"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "つまり俺達は、\n全力で王子にぶつかっていけばいいんだな？", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "クゥイル", "text": "はい。模擬戦とは言え、全力でお願いします。\n手を抜くような行為は――", "face": "u702"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "王子とやるのは久々だからな。\n腕が鳴るってもんだぜ。", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "コンラッド", "text": "一人前の山賊頭になれたかどうか、\nここらでひとつ、王子の器を見極めてやるか。", "face": "u61"}, {"name": "フューネス", "text": "王子……戦う……楽しい……頑張る……。", "face": "u15"}, {"name": "クゥイル", "text": "――どうやら、その心配はなさそうですね。\nそれでは最初の模擬戦を開始しましょう！", "face": "u702"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "コンラッド", "text": "王子よ、お前昔よりずっと強くなってんじゃねぇか？", "face": "u61"}, {"name": "フューネス", "text": "王子……強かった……すごい……楽しい……。", "face": "u15"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "こいつは負けちゃいられねぇな。\nおい野郎ども、あっちで模擬戦の続きだ！", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "クゥイル", "text": "……驚きました。王国では山賊が、\n我々に勝るとも劣らない実力を持っているのですね。", "face": "u702"}, {"name": "クゥイル", "text": "それに何より、彼らを退ける王子の武技と指揮。\n模擬戦の続きがより一層楽しみになりました。", "face": "u702"}, {"name": "クゥイル", "text": "まだまだ貴殿の、\n底の知れない実力を見せていただきますよ！", "face": "u702"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "それでは小休止を挟んでから、\n次の模擬戦に移りましょう。"}]}], "active": true}